      },
      {
        "text": "Return the beef to the pot with the 14 cups of fresh water, the onion and peppercorns. Bring to a boil, then lower to a bare simmer.",
        "minutes": null
      },
      {
        "text": "Partly cover and simmer until the meat is falling off the bone. Skim off fat now and then and top up with hot water to keep the meat covered.",
